  "ingredients": [
    "6 cups chicken stock",
    "1 pound red lentils",
    "3 tablespoons olive oil",
    "1 large onion, chopped",
    "1 tablespoon minced garlic",
    "1 tablespoon ground cumin",
    "0.5 teaspoon cayenne pepper",
    "0.75 cup fresh lemon juice",
    "0.5 cup chopped cilantro"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GqRjjd54l9tLfI7pKUfxpMNejiM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/139262-lebanese-style-red-lentil-soup-DDMFS-step-01_36158-b5f6b3cae9e04500b5cf02aeae9a0c4a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/139262/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring chicken stock and lentils to a boil in a large saucepan over high heat. Reduce heat to medium-low, cover, and simmer for 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pDpXIyCrm20BTQXVXbtdHmR5iD4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/139262-lebanese-style-red-lentil-soup-DDMFS-step-02_36164-7ee220c309544d8cac88c725f3c587ac.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/139262/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, heat olive oil in a skillet over medium heat. Stir in onion and garlic; cook until onion has softened and turned translucent, about 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/69V52MXZ9VbUAPO7gWZ7CMCwAQg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/139262-lebanese-style-red-lentil-soup-DDMFS-step-03a_36168-a453f6860b64444093b75134cce254eb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/139262/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir onion mixture into lentils; season with cumin and cayenne. Continue simmering until lentils are tender, about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EPAiPj-DukdjZy8_F-MF5NjA3o4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/139262-lebanese-style-red-lentil-soup-DDMFS-step-4a_36175-61852a161f1d4bacbba28850cb8ade46.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/139262/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Puree soup in a standing blender or with an immersion blender until smooth. Stir in lemon juice and cilantro.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wpR_VTngvmYFhkIzUkyfAQfWFlc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/139262-lebanese-style-red-lentil-soup-DDMFS-step-5_36254-66a71ce72bb5418796c3ab5df439a488.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/139262/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
